      "content": "hey so i've been on zoloft for like 2 years for my depression and its working fine but i messed up my back lifting something yesterday and the pain is killing me. i have some tramadol left over from a while ago, is it okay if i take that for the pain alongside my sertraline? i just really need to sleep tonight",
